<title>HONG KONG: Cheuk Nang 1995/96 net down 62.5 percent.</title>
<headline>Cheuk Nang 1995/96 net down 62.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  9.7   vs 25.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   1.5   vs 3.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 nil   vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			   20.32 vs 54.16</p>
<p>    Turnover		    91.53 vs 124.52</p>
<p>    Company name		Cheuk Nang Properties (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 November 25-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  December 20</p>
<p>NOTE - Cheuk Nang Properties is an investment holding and property investment firm.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 2.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of one cent) vs four cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
